    "description": {
      "value": "<h2 data-start=\"6963\" data-end=\"6998\">Level 14 — <strong data-start=\"6977\" data-end=\"6998\">Emotional Erasure</strong></h2><p data-start=\"7000\" data-end=\"7018\">You delete states.</p><h3 data-start=\"7020\" data-end=\"7042\">Mechanical Effects</h3><p data-start=\"7043\" data-end=\"7072\">Once per round, when you hit:</p><ul data-start=\"7073\" data-end=\"7202\"><li data-start=\"7073\" data-end=\"7137\"><p data-start=\"7075\" data-end=\"7137\">Remove one beneficial emotional, morale, or inspiration effect</p></li><li data-start=\"7138\" data-end=\"7202\"><p data-start=\"7140\" data-end=\"7202\">This bypasses resistance or mitigation tied to hope or courage</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"7204\" data-end=\"7219\">At <strong data-start=\"7207\" data-end=\"7218\">Burn 4+</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"7220\" data-end=\"7264\"><li data-start=\"7220\" data-end=\"7264\"><p data-start=\"7222\" data-end=\"7264\">The effect cannot be reapplied for 1 round</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"7266\" data-end=\"7302\">Some things do not get to come back.</p>",
